      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is such an awkward idea and way of thinking. You can already do that yourself by using something like chroma keys on OBS. The question is why would you do that? People are more interested in seeing an interesting avatar than some human with headset and controllers.\n\nThe point of avatars is to BE them. Say, I'm using a small, cute avatar. So I act like something small and cute. It is only natural for something small and cute. Then you see this greenscreen cutout of me doing these motions IRL and it suddenly becomes awkward. At this point the viewers will think \"I do not want to see the human. I want to see the small, cute avatar.\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
