  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-10-03T10:40:33.858Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Almost all of the users that come to vrchat is because of videos on youtube of vrchat.\n\nYoutubers can really share the experience of VR with Mixed reality .\nLike in the HTC Vive Trailer : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qYfNzhLXYGc\n\nThis feature would make More people experience vr on 2D => Make more people buy vr => More vr chat users",
